WEBVTT

00:11:28.684 --> 00:11:30.936
when you spend time
with a particular person,

00:11:30.978 --> 00:11:33.105
make a point to spend time
with that person.

00:11:33.147 --> 00:11:34.648
If you know there's an activity

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:38.444
that really does often generate
playful connected flow for you,

00:11:38.444 --> 00:11:40.654
carve out time for it in your schedule.

00:11:41.155 --> 00:11:43.323
Treat fun as if it is important.

00:11:43.323 --> 00:11:44.658
Because it is.

00:11:45.826 --> 00:11:48.454
I've been doing this myself
for a couple of years now,

00:11:48.454 --> 00:11:51.623
and it's amazing to see how many areas
of my life fun has touched.

00:11:51.665 --> 00:11:55.753
I'm more creative and more productive,
I'm more resilient.

00:11:55.794 --> 00:11:56.920
I laugh more.

00:11:57.379 --> 00:12:01.008
Making sure that I'm having enough fun
has made me a better partner,